.TH LIBUTF8 7 LIBUTF8
.SH NAME
libutf8 - UTF-8 encoding and decoding

.SH SYNOPSIS
.ni
#include <libutf8.h>
.fi
.PP
Link with
.IR -lutf8 .

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B libutf8
library provides functions for encoding and decoding
UTF-8 sequences, with flexibility in how invalid input is handled.
.PP
The library implements the following functions and macros:
.sp
.SS Encoding functions:
.TP
.BR libutf8_encode (3)
Encode a codepoint as UTF-8
.TP
.BR libutf8_encode_measure (3)
Get the number of bytes required to encode a codepoint
.sp
.SS Decoding functions:
.TP
.BR libutf8_decode (3)
Decode one sequence from a string
.TP
.BR libutf8_decode_mem (3)
Decode one sequence from a memory buffer
.sp
.SS Codepoint and byte test functions:
.TP
.BR libutf8_is_noncharacter (3)
Test whether a codepoint is a Unicode non-character codepoint
.TP
.BR libutf8_is_surrogate (3)
Test whether a codepoint is a UTF-16 surrogate
.TP
.BR libutf8_is_invalid (3)
Test whether a codepoint is invalid Unicode
.TP
.BR libutf8_is_valid (3)
Test whether a codepoint is valid Unicode
.TP
.BR libutf8_is_continuation (3)
Test whether a byte is a UTF-8 continuation byte
.sp
.SS Macro constants:
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_ULTIMATE_CODEPOINT (3)
The greatest Unicode codepoint
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT (3)
The Unicode replacement character as a codepoint
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8 (3)
The Unicode replacement character encoded as UTF-8
.sp
.SS Decoding flags:
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACE_INVALID (3)
Replace decoded invalid Unicode codepoints
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_RETURN_INVALID (3)
Return decoded invalid Unicode codepoints as is
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_ALLOW_31_BITS (3)
Accept decoded codepoints up to 31 bits
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_ALLOW_2BYTE_NULL (3)
Accept the two-byte overlong encoding of U+0000
.TP
.BR LIBUTF8_ALLOW_LONG_ENCODING (3)
Accept overlong UTF-8 encodings

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libgrapheme (7)
